# **FINAL DESIGN RULE**

Pathology / Laboratory Management System ka central workflow hoga:

**Patient → Test Order → Sample Collection → Sample Tracking → Processing → Result Entry → Professional Verification → Final Report → Delivery → Billing / Accounting Records**

Patient, test order, specimen, result, report, invoice aur payment ko properly linked entities rakho.

Har sample ki traceability, har result ki verification history aur har finalized report ki version history maintain honi chahiye.

**Ye complete Pathology / Laboratory role-wise blueprint hai. Ismein Radiology ke MRI, X-Ray, CT Scan, Ultrasound, Doppler ya PACS ke roles aur workflows include nahi hain.**\
